        {
          "text": "Qoomaadae al'axweesani ngiri oó' nee makaá sla/a nee tsir/ór gawaá doori, slám nee naanagár baraá hhape, as miwa slahh'eesiyé', ga/ale nee paánga ngay geeqáw nee xoslaá hatlá' awa slaqwara ngiri hingeés baraá yaamuwo. Aníng kuungá' nuri tsuúq, tari hotá' ar wayda.",
          "type": "text",
